---
import Container from '../common/Container.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../common/SectionHeading.astro';
import Icon from '../common/Icon.astro';
import Button from '../common/Button.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { buildWhatsAppLink } from '../../utils/whatsapp';

const mapSrc = 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3956.0573452603685!2d112.68800267540239!3d-7.458908492552493!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x2dd7e1b36275b4a9%3A0x1a95970a0db62903!2sAmartha%20Safira%20Sidoarjo!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sid!4v1789368585678!5m2!1sen!2sid';
---
<section id="pengiriman" class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white border-y border-border">
  <Container>
    <SectionHeading title="Cara Terima Pesanan" description="Amartha Safira kami antar gratis. Luar itu, ojek yang Anda pesan ambil ke titik kami agar telur cepat sampai dan aman." />
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <article class="reveal rounded-card-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8 bg-white shadow-card flex gap-5 card-hover">
          <span class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-soft-green text-primary">
            <Icon name="location" size={28} decorative />
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-text">Amartha Safira: Kami Antar Gratis</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              Untuk pemesanan di <strong class="text-text">{site.freeZones.join(', ')}</strong>, {site.serviceArea}, kami antar tanpa ongkir.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="reveal reveal-delay-1 rounded-card-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8 bg-white shadow-card flex gap-5 card-hover">
          <span class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-soft-green text-primary">
            <Icon name="truck" size={28} decorative />
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-text">Luar Zona: Ojek yang Anda Pesan</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              Di luar <strong class="text-text">{site.freeZones.join(', ')}</strong>, Anda pesan ojek (instan/same-day) ke titik ambil kami. Kami siapkan telur rapi agar aman dibawa. Ongkir ojek Anda yang tanggung.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <ul class="reveal rounded-card-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8 bg-soft-green-soft text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc pl-10">
          <li>{site.deliveryPromise}</li>
          <li>{site.deliveryNote}</li>
          <li>Di luar {site.serviceArea}? Sapa kami via WhatsApp dulu, kami info titik ambil dan kesiapan.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2">
          <Button
            href={buildWhatsAppLink('Halo OHMEGA, saya ingin menanyakan cara terima telur omega (diantar Amartha / ojek saya). Mohon informasinya.')}
            variant="whatsapp"
            size="md"
            iconLeft="message"
            external
            ariaLabel="Tanya cara terima via WhatsApp"
            data-track="whatsapp_click"
            data-source="delivery"
            data-package="general"
          >
            Tanya Cara Terima
          </Button>
          <Button
            href={'https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=' + site.baseLat + ',' + site.baseLng}
            variant="secondary"
            size="md"
            iconRight="external_link"
            external
            ariaLabel={`Buka petunjuk arah ke ${site.baseName} di Google Maps`}
          >
            Buka Petunjuk Arah
          </Button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
          Pemesanan, stok, dan kesiapan dikonfirmasi via WhatsApp. Di luar zona gratis, pelanggan memesan ojek sendiri.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="rounded-card-lg overflow-hidden shadow-card border border-border h-[320px] lg:h-full min-h-[280px] bg-soft-green relative">
          <iframe
            title="Peta titik ambil OHMEGA di Amartha Safira Sidoarjo"
            src={mapSrc}
            width="100%" height="100%"
            style="border:0;"
            allowfullscreen=""
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted text-center">Titik ambil: Amartha Safira Sidoarjo (<a class="font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-2" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=-7.458908492552493,112.68800267540239" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">buka petunjuk arah</a>). Amartha Safira kami antar; {site.serviceArea} lainnya via ojek yang Anda pesan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
